ight are unbalanced, werewolves go mad, and frost spreads; Liesa is resurrected.","participants":["emrakul","liesa"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"wiki/innistrad-plane","order":1932,"story_date":"","storyline":"Innistrad","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":34,"quote":"the day and night balance of Innistrad was disturbed","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Innistrad_%28plane%29#:~:text=the%20day%20and%20night,of%20Innistrad%20was%20disturbed","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Innistrad (plane)","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Innistrad_%28plane%29","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Innistrad_%28plane%29#:~:text=the%20day%20and%20night,of%20Innistrad%20was%20disturbed","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Innistrad (plane)\", section \"Fear of Eternal Night\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e4","era":null,"summary":"Algli finds a wounded angel behind her who says she is compelled to answer the call and that the Buried Lord is hungry.","participants":["algli","liesa"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":29,"quote":"\"But the Buried Lord has never been one to protect. He is here, and he is hungry.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=%22But%20the%20Buried%20Lord,and%20he%20is%20hungry.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=%22But%20the%20Buried%20Lord,and%20he%20is%20hungry.%22","archived":null,"lic